{"query": "mutation T($r0: ID!, $t0: [TranslationInput!]!, $r1: ID!, $t1: [TranslationInput!]!, $r2: ID!, $t2: [TranslationInput!]!, $r3: ID!, $t3: [TranslationInput!]!) { a0: translationsRegister(resourceId: $r0, translations: $t0) { userErrors { field message } } a1: translationsRegister(resourceId: $r1, translations: $t1) { userErrors { field message } } a2: translationsRegister(resourceId: $r2, translations: $t2) { userErrors { field message } } a3: translationsRegister(resourceId: $r3, translations: $t3) { userErrors { field message } } }", "variables": {"r0": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeJsonTemplate/index?theme_id=202178363656", "t0": [{"key": "section.index.json.hero_kivoa.content__h.text:1wt4awsu78raa", "value": "<h1>Their memory, forever on your wall</h1>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "9906764a369560708f1ef3798585e106062e9d2e4d7f5632c57b09d9aa479990"}, {"key": "section.index.json.hero_kivoa.content__p.text:1vo66m73ut2re", "value": "<p>We turn your photos into a one-of-a-kind illustrated portrait of your pet, with their name and date. Framed and ready to hang.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "12c7f18b18c5914375353c0e66fcf1df1b1ff85ab02255008e63cbadf496ab5b"}, {"key": "section.index.json.hero_kivoa.content__b.label:33mh1r1ndb6oj", "value": "Create their portrait", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "c986a0a1cb2b4c2c216f787871d9b6fc6cb571075923f1de67a6f9b58ad8364e"}, {"key": "section.index.json.marquee_confianza.t0.text:2or3b5u96qfse", "value": "<p>One-of-a-kind portrait from your photos</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "5848e650f4fe93a375315ae936fb452cc31fc4422492d8a403c81046c092ccfd"}, {"key": "section.index.json.marquee_confianza.t1.text:2icrp9p3ysblb", "value": "<p>Digital proof before printing</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "389ee0b53ead81a2f3950c74b318bf8e2e324844ca1b54d9756fbfb56b6bdc16"}, {"key": "section.index.json.marquee_confianza.t2.text:23o8tkb3npwto", "value": "<p>Tracked shipping to the US and Europe</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "d7c225a13e82744e080f7e61fa126ef23c7c0c2e46a2110c85f7b29c888c3741"}, {"key": "section.index.json.marquee_confianza.t3.text:1x9x7o5yfrsml", "value": "<p>Ready to hang, kit included</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "86ca70986a59a44609312bd93548a9eed969d23ba48be3b62c585e87d4de87f1"}, {"key": "section.index.json.marquee_confianza.t4.text:1d8y8m4cwrjhm", "value": "<p>100% secure checkout</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "f85850351f055c54b8e8988d27a2f8cbeccbf3d3e4df073b715a4615810d17c2"}, {"key": "section.index.json.antes_despues.col__h.text:28zpstw53si3x", "value": "<h2>From your photo to their portrait</h2>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "f693d33adda770364993b4f3173a05bfdb7c5f10f0bc86326ae37bb72e27ae3a"}, {"key": "section.index.json.antes_despues.col__p.text:yvzw0juwko8l", "value": "<p>Drag the slider and see the difference. All we need is one good photo of your companion: we create the illustration, pick the colors of their style and add their name, their traits and that date you never want to forget.</p><p>Before printing, we send you a digital proof to approve.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "f34805f21b2bd22f37db41d155246833429e508ceeded800a39457215990ced1"}, {"key": "section.index.json.antes_despues.col__b.label:2vpuh0mrpnwe4", "value": "See styles", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "9db653f003a5256f6e8fd9f2e4233ab4252087e871b3dd165f5e27e9d2c9c37a"}, {"key": "section.index.json.antes_despues.slider.before_text:1k4vtdzze5y3q", "value": "Your photo", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "9d3baf2c65d56b0f45cb596fbf77d6a6a53c7902a2d70ec1ad503379ba3c0a9d"}, {"key": "section.index.json.antes_despues.slider.after_text:2p2jgj4r1b4m3", "value": "Their portrait", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "e28581cf87d1ddad4c9ec7d7352d5e23a432b2d3d7342454d6fbc2af79bfb6cb"}, {"key": "section.index.json.product_list_fa6P9H.static-header__product_list_text_YFtzcL.text:3swl12a07tofk", "value": "<h3>Choose their style</h3>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "ff79101129d182055f86624a95dad295cfc9ff5e8474347d3e17bfbe4e17ae38"}, {"key": "section.index.json.product_list_fa6P9H.static-header__product_list_button_MWeP9V.label:11xltcn0p7x4u", "value": "View all", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "e30fbc949891c04bf6cbe3239e976c8baae21c9310dc09591abacc231a26d831"}, {"key": "section.index.json.como_funciona.h.text:202n3wulhpqpk", "value": "<h2>How it works</h2>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "68cf26cb6104232faa11fc6e8a374185119c22fa8de7385821b109498058f4f0"}, {"key": "section.index.json.como_funciona.row__p1__t.text:3gk3pez23mbtb", "value": "<h3>Choose a style and upload your photos</h3>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "c8159b1a5770664021f45274acf1678efaba4dff2ac97515b73424cb406d2a0a"}, {"key": "section.index.json.como_funciona.row__p1__d.text:2sxrov01tskm7", "value": "<p>One sharp main photo and up to 3 extra ones. Add their name, their traits, a quote and a date.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "d482c30aac3e9cac3d0b23ab78982ef4b3383835c864da3f9765d732af312666"}, {"key": "section.index.json.como_funciona.row__p2__t.text:3p5undfs40tkc", "value": "<h3>We create their portrait</h3>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "f485973ff49745f24182746a372f6aeafa5c40c495496d360f04473c0678ec1a"}, {"key": "section.index.json.como_funciona.row__p2__d.text:31jimtgru72d8", "value": "<p>We design the illustration and send you a digital proof. Nothing is printed without your approval.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "a34ccaa25400baca7ba5f01cf2c16add0733d99313f2aa29b8960d6a81a0a2e3"}, {"key": "section.index.json.como_funciona.row__p3__t.text:mrtnzh3fkaz1", "value": "<h3>It arrives ready to hang</h3>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "9d6f3309caf605dbadd0f7de2b0c3a4ca85075295134bc467ced83ce0a55dfc3"}, {"key": "section.index.json.como_funciona.row__p3__d.text:3vavogk9aj0kd", "value": "<p>Printed on high-quality paper, framed and with a hanging kit. Tracked shipping.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "e392e7f166b8ed0634dd55800dd58e25d7164a44db5248c0611f3d663e6a58e7"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.h.text:1eupwazwi17vx", "value": "<h2>Frequently asked questions</h2>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "fc38896d77242e2413c92c72a0c379a65abc258db6105fe20a4e3b272a6d4f14"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r0.heading:1vhwm9teezltf", "value": "What photo do I need?", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "e571ca7f497c99ba4c89a57be329076cd6a46bd75aa45eb112c2a0fc17dd0fbe"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r0__t.text:26wz3q5u1xp2q", "value": "<p>A sharp, well-lit photo where your pet's face is clearly visible. If a photo doesn't work, we'll email you before we start and ask for another one.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "feb51b8a85b4102ad00646439fe5d18471c6638667a68ccfdb6f157e1d7c9c44"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r1.heading:3psjzxttjgbv6", "value": "Will I see the portrait before it's printed?", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "5977a89aaf1d5a77db1317ab51741189a3b86d7aa7d7b0ae2131f4b6df258539"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r1__t.text:ncit8o5v8843", "value": "<p>Yes. Within 48 business hours we email you a digital proof. It includes up to 2 rounds of changes, and nothing is printed until you approve it.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "4b92230ad73bf59f2f13d778d8ca0ae3afb89a4860426c3161db6b080db5b72d"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r2.heading:1lrnv3mmwh981", "value": "How long does delivery take?", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "d47c735efcc9b418c5979815d631645f96d090a55e82410fa029853d167697c0"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r2__t.text:1m0ftxwy9dto0", "value": "<p>2–4 business days of production after you approve the proof, plus shipping: about 3–7 business days within the US and 4–8 within Europe. You'll receive a tracking number by email.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "8668432897d9b4722f42db9d454899e3aec9132607cc462fe9c37a209fa236da"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r3.heading:3g2b8rn20xz9s", "value": "How are the portraits made?", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "ddfe2b328c6b74f942a1f01bda4204a6567ccfba7a0388e34d5172a82066b767"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r3__t.text:3iuw1jatk8nkh", "value": "<p>We design each portrait from your photos using digital tools, including artificial intelligence, and review and fine-tune every single one before printing.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "d18b8d2629ffef1966b68c00f5641602dd192e8a1f0b24e1f03cb3d97915f42d"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r4.heading:2b1qjg1d107uf", "value": "Can I return it?", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "122be472b5deda3ddbdaf661eca8ce2b508245a28cad5f5260cfdcdbc1326aa3"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r4__t.text:2kqi68yz9vcmu", "value": "<p>Because each portrait is custom-made, we can't accept returns for change of mind. But if it arrives damaged, defective or doesn't match the proof you approved, we'll reprint it or refund you.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "680bb9ee3d8ad3959d36ebae8408f67b9aa0c5120bf323cb384b82be94f7d36d"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r5.heading:96zw2zm0oh3q", "value": "Which frames and sizes are available?", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "f1b01a1eb7f9e7bf30cb66d33295c186285c2c12e18626a2719bd9159e776fe9"}, {"key": "section.index.json.faq_kivoa.acc__r5__t.text:1161vrhb35vo7", "value": "<p>Three sizes (8×10\", 12×16\" and 20×28\") and three wooden frame finishes: white, black or natural. All include shatterproof acrylic and a hanging kit.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "e01d2382247ad2b882c29737fec78dc8d09e19fee12dbdb202b51b0eb16b2c2c"}], "r1": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeJsonTemplate/product?theme_id=202178363656", "t1": [{"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__confianza__a__t.text:25wgk8n84olcw", "value": "<p>Digital proof before printing</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "389ee0b53ead81a2f3950c74b318bf8e2e324844ca1b54d9756fbfb56b6bdc16"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__confianza__b__t.text:1xapma6i4a3lv", "value": "<p>Production 2–4 days + tracked shipping</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "e44066407b0dabf987e4155237afecf3002b2e6787560b0c49a7ef05110922b9"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__confianza__c__t.text:1j9u3l9nb6bc2", "value": "<p>100% secure checkout · Ready to hang, kit included</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "b4f2f5a54570710c68486942da39c2f7a8c2194d3e34eaf76a03c32f3a00eb33"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r0.heading:3tc7n1o162dl9", "value": "What photos I need", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "9e09eee2832f0e6dbaeba547fa3564fb36ee2ceedc3b6f82277b28c3806b0ff6"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r0__t.text:266rf52cn5vt8", "value": "<p>One sharp, well-lit main photo where their face is clearly visible, plus up to 3 optional extra photos. If a photo doesn't work, we'll email you before we start.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "6476dd8b3a521338051df83f489aca2fa310ed632f7786107bf82c6f54642a93"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r1.heading:318ec0idyicz0", "value": "Shipping & timing", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "c49e4262ce1b46604e376168bf1795e297ee08875fb23f6a1411814a97fe66f1"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r1__t.text:6s9xq98xppgt", "value": "<p>We send your digital proof within 48 business hours. After your approval: 2–4 business days of production and tracked shipping (about 3–7 business days in the US, 4–8 in Europe). <a href=\"/pages/envios-y-devoluciones\">More info</a>.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "d8e85387c9aa8b6ffd7dd32e3066da054aa6ca56f55845eb0b330e79995b291c"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r2.heading:36bc0x2n8ysun", "value": "Returns & guarantee", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "a7b46c19b125abdf20400f690d7eec1a6590c4cb38dc917e0c12cce4dd854ca0"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r2__t.text:38ggq01mw4mj2", "value": "<p>Custom-made items can't be returned for change of mind, but if yours arrives damaged, defective or doesn't match your order, we'll reprint it or refund you. <a href=\"/pages/envios-y-devoluciones#devoluciones\">See policy</a>.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "21e07ac36f90df13d6c9609c21685cb9ca6658ccecc1d4dd6237765234941319"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r3.heading:2agwmf8kwtvn2", "value": "How your portrait is made", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "b194ecee1b1fbd5aa7cb2b5d9efa6d63fecb87150a4a102bc3d44dc66b2df77a"}, {"key": "section.product.json.main.product-details__faq__r3__t.text:32a3qhi8zsy5r", "value": "<p>We design the illustration from your photos using digital tools, including artificial intelligence, and review and fine-tune each one before printing.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "3997a27b0d68b37d6bc7a5b4316c3d67f0ab18b7f2f6cafbd4c8ec8cab3f7eb5"}, {"key": "section.product.json.product_recommendations_qggXJq.text_cbcgyb.text:26lmab1lb8sv0", "value": "<h3>You may also like</h3>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "3b6e2fe1c418ffea2a8f851f948016dcb2ce745e63896358d6645ade5268d686"}], "r2": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeSectionGroup/header-group?theme_id=202178363656", "t2": [{"key": "section.sections/header-group.json.header_announcements_9jGBFp.announcement_BxgCk9.text:pmxvxwkljjsj", "value": "Tracked shipping to the US & Europe · Digital proof before printing", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "1a14b9ad13696af3b17c75fe5956e99e4d7d29b7502049ef35a121021373f4e3"}], "r3": "gid://shopify/OnlineStoreThemeSectionGroup/footer-group?theme_id=202178363656", "t3": [{"key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.footer_m9NzUG.group_H6VpwJ__text_LWt8Pz.text:11a6kwfibxsn8", "value": "<h2>Join the Kivoa family</h2>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "5fe8a7d3b47d3f8f8e59a38895441185189443f816d327811077ffb3e74a7e30"}, {"key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.footer_m9NzUG.group_H6VpwJ__text_f9CFLH.text:ne10ekm1b2pz", "value": "<p>Get news, new styles and special offers. No spam.</p>", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "cfc3dae84ba96d952ccd1411d0584a2a64d68940c99d876ea23692201fdb3d8d"}, {"key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.footer_m9NzUG.email_signup_crihX7.label:r7nsgb9ylyzk", "value": "Subscribe", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "177807474ddd6b3f13e0ac83859b8d49d220d725ede3a3133f1ff3038ba4feb9"}, {"key": "section.sections/footer-group.json.footer_m9NzUG.menu_info.heading:1eqk2phn8ptmx", "value": "Information", "locale": "en", "translatableContentDigest": "7263ec8c2d08c2c0911277d71a91c27a0e80b51e6d4d0e8d49e6d348f266face"}]}}